                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te Isiboseti Saulo mvi ovu ’ba iri ovupi ambo asikari ongulumuru drilia ’diyi be; aluri ma ru Baana’i, iriri ma ru Rekabu’i yi anzi Rimoni agu Beerotia, suru Benyaminini vileri (a’disiku Beeroti yi la eri Benya­miniri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
