        },
        {
          "text": "Te Yonatani Saulo mvi ovu mva pa acozaruri be. Eli erini ovu towi e’yo kuza Saulo pini Yonatani beri ka efu Yezireeliasi; endria ’du eri, apa ra; eri eca ’dini, erini aparia ongusi, mva ’de va, pa erini aco ani. Ru erini Mefiboseti’i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
