        {
          "text": "Te Rimoni ’ba Beerotiari ma anzipi, yi Rekabu pi Baana be, yi mu, yi ca ekile etuni dri okporuria Isiboseti vile joa, erini ava liria etu agaduaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
