        },
        {
          "text": "Te Daudi omvi e’yo Rekabu pi ma tia adri Baana be, yi anzi Rimoni agu Beerotiari vile ’diyi, ’yo yi tia kini, Ekile Yehova orindi mani papi candi dria ma eseliarini ovule idrirurile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
